# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   —— 不超过 72 字符，祈使句，结尾无句号
# type: feat | fix | docs | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# scope: api | runtime | context | memory | policy | events | models | capabilities
#        mcp | skills | devices | workflows | protocol | observability
#        web | desktop | mobile | cli | deploy | deps | docs
#
# body：解释「为什么」，每行不超过 100 字符，可省略
#
# footer：BREAKING CHANGE: ... | Closes #123
#
# 规范详见 docs/commit-convention.md
